        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 183fc655ca7b291ffc84869981ee36f17adaf7ac\nparent e74a0187aac1cac734d5ad23ca5e40ceb6ddd4a8\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792582382 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1793418549 +0700\n\ndoc: describe how to reduce the binary size\n\nCompiling with -ffunction-sections -fdata-sections and linking with\n-Wl,--gc-sections lets the linker drop the precomputed tables and code\nthat a program never calls. Document this in the README, with the API\nfunctions that use each table, the options that set the table sizes and\nthe advice against -Os.\n\nAddresses the last open item of #1065.\n",
